    "Lung cancer, Factsheet, WHO. Aggiornato al 26 giugno 2023. Disponibile online all’indirizzo: https://www.who.int/news-room/fact-sheets/detail/lung-cancer. Ultimo accesso: 22.04.2024.",
    "de Groot P, Munden RF. Lung cancer epidemiology, risk factors, and prevention. Radiol Clin North Am. 2012 Sep;50(5):863-76.",
